--
-- Safe to run repeatedly: every row has a deterministic id and is upserted,
-- so a second run updates content in place and creates no duplicates.
--
-- Seeds CONTENT ONLY. No users, no progress, no assessment attempts - those
-- are created by people using the system.
--
-- Source: the training documents transcribed into src/data/. Where a document
-- refers to information it does not supply (product specifications, package
-- prices, flavours), the row is seeded with a null value so the UI shows
-- "Admin content required" instead of an invented figure.
